"The platforms of departures used for each 'sub-journey' of a journey.<nl/>"
"If <emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> and <emphasis>RoutePlatformsDeparture</emphasis> are both set, the latter should contain one element less (because the last stop has no departure, only an arrival platform). Elements with equal indices should be associated (the platforms from which the vehicle departs from the stops)."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk
#: javascriptcompletionmodel.cpp:500
msgctxt "@info The description for the 'RoutePlatformsArrival' info"
msgid ""
"The platforms of arrivals used for each 'sub-journey' of a journey.<nl/>"
"If <emphasis>RouteStops</emphasis> and <emphasis>RoutePlatformsArrival</emphasis> are both set, the latter should contain one element less (because the first stop has no arrival, only a departure platform). Elements with equal indices should be associated (the platforms at which the vehicle arrives at the stops)"
msgstr ""

